WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.935
AUTOMATED VOICE:<i> Hello.
 This is a free call from</i>

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:07.072
<i> an inmate at Denver Sheriff's
 Department County Jail.</i>

00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:09.275
ELISABETH EPPS: Hi, good
afternoon, how can I help you?

00:00:11.343 --> 00:00:14.080
<i> Everyone who we post bond for
 is legally innocent.</i>

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.247
SPEAKER:
<i> I'm wondering if I qualify.</i>

00:00:15.548 --> 00:00:16.916
EPPS:<i> The letters
 come addressed to me.</i>

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.184
<i> "Dear Ms. Elisabeth."</i>

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.420
<i> They're often full
 of really difficult stories.</i>

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.088
"Three bonds preventing me
from release."

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.656
<i> Total, 11,000 dollars.</i>

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:24.724
<i> I've been arrested...</i>

00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:26.559
<i> Take your hands off of me!</i>

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:27.493
<i> ...went to law school.</i>

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:28.928
Of course I would be
directing a bail fund.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:31.164
<i> When I'm looking
 at a jail roster</i>

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.199
<i> and I'm seeing how many
 people we got out,</i>

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.501
<i> all I can really see is
 how many people are still in.</i>

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.837
SPEAKER 2:<i> Is there any way
 you guys can help me?</i>

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:41.974
EPPS:<i> I get overwhelmed
 thinking about who's not
 gonna be home for Christmas.</i>

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:44.343
I saw Elisabeth paying
someone's bond.

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:46.011
<i>"This is the money for this one,
 this one, this one."</i>

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:48.047
Let's start with Ms. Payne.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.449
<i> Liberation is not
 a zero-sum game.</i>

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:51.817
I get more free.

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.386
<i> You get okay too.</i>

